Description: guard diff output options (GHSA-fjr4-x663-mwxc)
 Reject unsafe diff options such as --output before revision parsing or Git
 invocation so callers cannot write command output to arbitrary filesystem
 paths. Covers commit/tree diffs and index diffs, including option-like
 revisions, and preserves an explicit allow_unsafe_options escape hatch.
 .
 Relies on Git._option_candidates and Repo.unsafe_git_revision_options from
 GHSA-956x-8gvw-wg5v (applied earlier in patch_dirs).
Origin: https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython/pull/2180

